    "D\u0131\u015fa D\u00f6n\u00fck Kanallar": "Canais de sa\u00edda", // EN: Outbound Channels
    "Olaylar uygulaman\u0131n i\u00e7inde kal\u0131r; istersen ayn\u0131 uyar\u0131y\u0131 telefonunun uyar\u0131 merkezine veya Telegram'a da g\u00f6nder. Hi\u00e7biri zorunlu de\u011fil.": "Os eventos ficam dentro do app;se quiser, envie o mesmo alerta para a central de notifica\u00e7\u00f5es do seu celular ou para o Telegram.Nada disso \u00e9 necess\u00e1rio.", // EN: Events stay inside the app; if you want, send the same alert to your phone's notification centre or to Telegram. None of these is required.
    "Konu ad\u0131 yaz, hesap gerekmez": "Insira um nome de t\u00f3pico \u2013 nenhuma conta \u00e9 necess\u00e1ria", // EN: Enter a topic name — no account needed
    "Konu (topic)": "T\u00f3pico", // EN: Topic
    "Bildirimler ntfy.sh \u00fczerinde bu konuya g\u00f6nderilir; konu ad\u0131n\u0131 sadece sen biliyorsan bildirimi sadece sen al\u0131rs\u0131n.": "As notifica\u00e7\u00f5es s\u00e3o publicadas neste t\u00f3pico em ntfy.sh;se voc\u00ea souber o nome do t\u00f3pico, somente voc\u00ea os receber\u00e1.", // EN: Notifications are published to this topic on ntfy.sh; if only you know the topic name, only you receive them.
    "E-posta": "E-mail", // EN: Email
    "Uyar\u0131lar hesab\u0131n\u0131n e-posta adresine gider": "Os alertas s\u00e3o enviados para o endere\u00e7o de e-mail da sua conta", // EN: Alerts are sent to your account's email address
    "Bulut oturumu a\u00e7\u0131kken kendi adresine g\u00f6nderilir; saklanacak anahtar yok.": "Enviado para seu pr\u00f3prio endere\u00e7o enquanto estiver conectado;nenhum segredo \u00e9 armazenado no aplicativo.", // EN: Sent to your own address while signed in; no secrets are stored in the app.
    "G\u00f6nderilecek adres": "Destinat\u00e1rio", // EN: Recipient
    "Cihazlar Aras\u0131 Bildirim": "Notifica\u00e7\u00f5es entre dispositivos", // EN: Cross-device Notifications
    "Aile \u00fcyesinin uyar\u0131s\u0131, o ki\u015finin uygulamas\u0131 kapal\u0131yken de bildirim merkezine d\u00fc\u015fer": "O alerta de um familiar chega na central de notifica\u00e7\u00f5es mesmo quando o app est\u00e1 fechado", // EN: A family member's alert arrives in the notification centre even when the app is closed
    "Di\u011fer \u00fcyelerin ve kendi di\u011fer cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n bildirim merkezine gider; al\u0131c\u0131 bu kanal\u0131 kendi cihaz\u0131nda a\u00e7m\u0131\u015f olmal\u0131.": "Vai para os centros de notifica\u00e7\u00e3o de outros membros e de seus outros dispositivos;o destinat\u00e1rio deve ter este canal habilitado em seu dispositivo.", // EN: Goes to other members' and your other devices' notification centres; the recipient must have this channel enabled on their device.
    "Kendi sunucuna JSON POST \u2014 geli\u015fmi\u015f": "JSON POST para seu pr\u00f3prio servidor \u2013 avan\u00e7ado", // EN: JSON POST to your own server — advanced
    "HTTPS adresi": "URL HTTPS", // EN: HTTPS URL
    "Yaln\u0131zca HTTPS kabul edilir; her olay {source, id, title, detail, ts} olarak g\u00f6nderilir.": "Somente HTTPS \u00e9 aceito;cada evento \u00e9 enviado como {fonte, id, t\u00edtulo, detalhe, ts}.", // EN: Only HTTPS is accepted; each event is sent as {source, id, title, detail, ts}.
    "Bot anahtar\u0131": "Token de bot", // EN: Bot token
    "Sohbet ID": "ID do bate-papo", // EN: Chat ID
    "Bot anahtar\u0131 yaln\u0131zca bu cihazda kal\u0131r": "O token do bot permanece apenas neste dispositivo", // EN: The bot token stays on this device only
    "Anahtar buluta y\u00fcklenmez; di\u011fer cihazlarda tekrar girmen gerekir.": "O token nunca \u00e9 carregado na nuvem;insira-o novamente em outros dispositivos.", // EN: The token is never uploaded to the cloud; re-enter it on other devices.
    "Sistem Bildirimleri": "Notifica\u00e7\u00f5es do sistema", // EN: System Notifications
    "Taray\u0131c\u0131 ve telefonun uyar\u0131 merkezi": "Seu navegador e centro de notifica\u00e7\u00e3o do telefone", // EN: Your browser and phone notification centre
    "\u0130zin bekleniyor\u2026": "Aguardando permiss\u00e3o\u2026", // EN: Waiting for permission…
