    "De\u011fi\u015fiklikler otomatik kaydedilir.": "As altera\u00e7\u00f5es s\u00e3o salvas automaticamente.", // EN: Changes are saved automatically.
    "Bildirim motoru bu s\u00fcr\u00fcmde y\u00fcklenmedi.": "O mecanismo de notifica\u00e7\u00e3o n\u00e3o foi carregado nesta compila\u00e7\u00e3o.", // EN: The notification engine didn't load in this build.
    "A\u00e7\u0131k kanal": "Canal aberto", // EN: Open channel
