    "Bu 8 haneli kod Apple HomeKit e\u015fle\u015ftirmesi i\u00e7indir ve yaln\u0131zca Apple Ev uygulamas\u0131yla kullan\u0131l\u0131r. Cihaz Shelly, WLED, Tasmota gibi yerel API destekliyorsa yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Este c\u00f3digo de 8 d\u00edgitos \u00e9 para emparelhamento do Apple HomeKit e funciona apenas com o aplicativo Apple Home.Se o dispositivo suportar uma API local como Shelly, WLED ou Tasmota, voc\u00ea poder\u00e1 adicion\u00e1-lo de sua rede local.", // EN: This 8-digit code is for Apple HomeKit pairing and only works with the Apple Home app. If the device supports a local API such as Shelly, WLED or Tasmota, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu Cihaz": "Este dispositivo", // EN: This Device
    "Bu QR kodu bir Wi-Fi a\u011f\u0131na aittir, cihaz de\u011fildir. Cihaz\u0131 ayn\u0131 a\u011fa ba\u011flad\u0131ktan sonra yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Este c\u00f3digo QR pertence a uma rede Wi-Fi, n\u00e3o a um dispositivo.Depois de conectar o dispositivo \u00e0 mesma rede, voc\u00ea pode adicion\u00e1-lo da sua rede local.", // EN: This QR code belongs to a Wi-Fi network, not a device. After connecting the device to the same network, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu adreste bilinen bir NEXUS cihaz\u0131 bulunamad\u0131. Cihaz\u0131n ayn\u0131 a\u011fda ve a\u00e7\u0131k oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Nenhum dispositivo NEXUS conhecido foi encontrado neste endere\u00e7o.Certifique-se de que o dispositivo esteja ligado e na mesma rede.", // EN: No known NEXUS device was found at this address. Make sure the device is on and on the same network.
    "Bu ak\u0131ll\u0131 uygulamay\u0131 olu\u015ftur:": "Crie este aplicativo inteligente:", // EN: Create this smart app:
    "Bu ak\u0131\u015f i\u00e7in \u00f6nerilen \u00f6zellikler haz\u0131rlan\u0131yor.": "Preparando recursos sugeridos para este fluxo.", // EN: Preparing suggested features for this flow.
    "Bu ayki tasarruf": "Salvo este m\u00eas", // EN: Saved this month
    "Bu a\u011fda desteklenen bir cihaz bulunamad\u0131.": "Nenhum dispositivo compat\u00edvel foi encontrado nesta rede.", // EN: No supported device was found on this network.
    "Bu a\u011fda desteklenen bir cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 Wi-Fi'da oldu\u011fundan emin ol; olmazsa a\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan katalo\u011fu ya da QR / kurulum kodunu kullan.": "Nenhum dispositivo compat\u00edvel foi encontrado nesta rede.Certifique-se de que o dispositivo esteja ligado e conectado ao mesmo Wi-Fi;caso contr\u00e1rio, use o cat\u00e1logo abaixo ou um c\u00f3digo QR/configura\u00e7\u00e3o.", // EN: No supported device was found on this network. Make sure the device is on and connected to the same Wi-Fi; otherwise use the catalog below or a QR / setup code.
    "Bu cihaz i\u00e7in yerel koruma": "Prote\u00e7\u00e3o local para este dispositivo", // EN: Local protection for this device
    "Bu cihaz s\u00fcr\u00fcm bilgisi payla\u015fm\u0131yor": "Este dispositivo n\u00e3o compartilha informa\u00e7\u00f5es de vers\u00e3o", // EN: This device doesn't share version info
    "Bu cihaz veya ba\u011flant\u0131 fener deste\u011fi sunmuyor.": "Este dispositivo ou conex\u00e3o n\u00e3o suporta lanterna.", // EN: This device or connection doesn't support the flashlight.
    "Bu cihazda otomatik konum deste\u011fi yok.": "Este dispositivo n\u00e3o oferece suporte \u00e0 localiza\u00e7\u00e3o autom\u00e1tica.", // EN: This device doesn't support automatic location.
    "Bu davet kodu bulunamad\u0131.": "Este c\u00f3digo de convite n\u00e3o foi encontrado.", // EN: This invite code wasn't found.
    "Bu ekran, ekledi\u011fin ayd\u0131nlatma cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 odalara g\u00f6re toplar; sahne kaydetti\u011finde \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131n parlakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve tonu birlikte ayarlan\u0131r.": "Esta tela agrupa os dispositivos de ilumina\u00e7\u00e3o que voc\u00ea adicionou por ambiente;quando voc\u00ea salva uma cena, o brilho e o tom s\u00e3o definidos juntos.", // EN: This screen groups the lighting devices you've added by room; when you save a scene, brightness and tone are set together.
    "Bu eve ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada listelenir.": "Os dispositivos que voc\u00ea adiciona a esta p\u00e1gina inicial est\u00e3o listados aqui.", // EN: Devices you add to this home are listed here.
    "Bu eve ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada listelenir ve favori kartlar\u0131na ba\u011flan\u0131r.": "Os dispositivos que voc\u00ea adiciona a esta p\u00e1gina inicial s\u00e3o listados aqui e vinculados aos seus cart\u00f5es favoritos.", // EN: Devices you add to this home are listed here and linked to your favorite cards.
    "Bu evi ve t\u00fcm ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silmek istedi\u011fine emin misin?": "Tem certeza de que deseja excluir permanentemente esta casa e todas as suas configura\u00e7\u00f5es?", // EN: Are you sure you want to permanently delete this home and all its settings?
    "Bu kod desteklenen bir cihaz kodu de\u011fil. Cihaz\u0131n IP adresini biliyorsan yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Este c\u00f3digo n\u00e3o \u00e9 um c\u00f3digo de dispositivo compat\u00edvel.Se voc\u00ea souber o endere\u00e7o IP do dispositivo, poder\u00e1 adicion\u00e1-lo na sua rede local.", // EN: This code isn't a supported device code. If you know the device's IP address, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu markalar yerel a\u011fdan kontrol edilir": "Essas marcas s\u00e3o controladas pela sua rede local", // EN: These brands are controlled over your local network
