    "Cihaz\u0131n IP adresini yaz, NEXUS konu\u015fabildi\u011fi protokol\u00fc kendisi anlas\u0131n.": "Digite o endere\u00e7o IP do dispositivo e o NEXUS descobrir\u00e1 qual protocolo ele fala.", // EN: Type the device's IP address and NEXUS figures out which protocol it speaks.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modemini kontrol et. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekle. Ad\u0131mlar: Cihazlar > cihaz\u0131 se\u00e7 > Kald\u0131r.": "Verifique a conex\u00e3o Wi-Fi do dispositivo e do seu roteador.Se o problema persistir, remova o dispositivo e adicione-o novamente.Passos: Dispositivos > escolha o dispositivo > Remover.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device and add it again. Steps: Devices > choose the device > Remove.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modeminizi kontrol edin. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 NEXUS uygulamas\u0131ndan kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekleyin.": "Verifique a conex\u00e3o Wi-Fi do dispositivo e do seu roteador.Se o problema persistir, remova o dispositivo do aplicativo NEXUS e adicione-o novamente.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device from the NEXUS app and add it again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n g\u00f6r\u00fcnm\u00fcyorsa QR tarama veya kurulum kodu yolunu kullan. Destek ve y\u00f6nlendirme i\u00e7in yard\u0131m sayfas\u0131n\u0131 a\u00e7abilirsin.": "Se o seu dispositivo n\u00e3o aparecer, use a leitura QR ou um c\u00f3digo de configura\u00e7\u00e3o.Voc\u00ea pode abrir a p\u00e1gina de ajuda para suporte e orienta\u00e7\u00e3o.", // EN: If your device doesn't show up, use QR scanning or a setup code. You can open the help page for support and guidance.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum (GPS) servisi kapal\u0131. A\u00e7\u0131p tekrar dene.": "O servi\u00e7o de localiza\u00e7\u00e3o (GPS) do seu dispositivo est\u00e1 desativado.Ligue-o e tente novamente.", // EN: Your device's location (GPS) service is off. Turn it on and try again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum servisini desteklemiyor.": "Seu dispositivo n\u00e3o oferece suporte a servi\u00e7os de localiza\u00e7\u00e3o.", // EN: Your device doesn't support location services.
