    "Evde a\u00e7\u0131k kalan t\u00fcm ayd\u0131nlatma gruplar\u0131n\u0131 kapat.": "Desligue todos os grupos de ilumina\u00e7\u00e3o deixados em casa.", // EN: Turn off all lighting groups left on at home.
    "Evde ve D\u0131\u015far\u0131da": "Em casa e fora", // EN: At Home and Away
    "Evde yok": "Longe", // EN: Away
    "Evde yokken": "Quando estiver fora", // EN: When away
    "Evdeki ayd\u0131nlatma cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 oda bazl\u0131 tek bir ak\u0131\u015f i\u00e7inde y\u00f6net. A\u00e7 kapa, parlakl\u0131k, renk s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve h\u0131zl\u0131 sahne k\u0131sayollar\u0131 ayn\u0131 uygulamada toplans\u0131n.": "Gerencie as luzes da sua casa, c\u00f4modo por c\u00f4modo, em um \u00fanico fluxo.Ligar/desligar, brilho, temperatura de cor e atalhos r\u00e1pidos de cena em um \u00fanico aplicativo.", // EN: Manage the lights in your home room by room in one flow. On/off, brightness, color temperature and quick scene shortcuts in one app.
    "Evdeki cihazlara g\u00f6re haz\u0131r komutlar, h\u0131zl\u0131 otomasyonlar ve ak\u0131ll\u0131 uygulama \u00f6nerileri ver.": "Forne\u00e7a comandos prontos, automa\u00e7\u00f5es r\u00e1pidas e sugest\u00f5es de aplicativos inteligentes com base nos dispositivos de sua casa.", // EN: Give ready commands, quick automations and smart app suggestions based on the devices at home.
    "Evdeki klima ve termostatlar\u0131 tek panelde y\u00f6neten bir iklim konfor uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. S\u0131cakl\u0131k ayar\u0131, h\u0131zl\u0131 mod se\u00e7enekleri, eko modu ve oda bazl\u0131 kontrol aksiyonlar\u0131 olsun.": "Crie um aplicativo de conforto clim\u00e1tico que gerencia os ACs e termostatos da sua casa a partir de um painel.Inclui controle de temperatura, modos r\u00e1pidos, modo eco e a\u00e7\u00f5es baseadas na sala.", // EN: Create a climate comfort app that manages the ACs and thermostats in your home from one panel. Include temperature control, quick modes, eco mode and room-based actions.
    "Evimdeki cihazlar\u0131n durumu nedir?": "Qual \u00e9 o status dos meus dispositivos?", // EN: What is the status of my devices?
