    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f\u0131 Tamamla": "Terminar de sair de casa", // EN: Finish Leaving Home
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilit durumunu ve enerji ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 tek ekranda g\u00f6steren bir \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f kontrol\u00fc uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma ve g\u00fcvenlik aktif etme butonlar\u0131 ekle.": "Crie um aplicativo de verifica\u00e7\u00e3o de sa\u00edda de casa que mostre os dispositivos deixados ligados, bloqueie o status e as configura\u00e7\u00f5es de energia em uma tela.Adicione bot\u00f5es de desligamento r\u00e1pido e ativa\u00e7\u00e3o de seguran\u00e7a.", // EN: Create a leaving-home check app that shows devices left on, lock status and energy settings on one screen. Add quick shut-off and security activation buttons.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilitleri ve enerji durumunu tek ak\u0131\u015fta kontrol edin.": "Verifique dispositivos deixados ligados, bloqueios e status de energia em um \u00fanico fluxo ao sair de casa.", // EN: Check devices left on, locks and energy status in one flow when leaving home.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilitleri ve enerji durumunu tek ekranda g\u00f6ster.": "Mostre dispositivos deixados ligados, bloqueios e status de energia em uma tela ao sair de casa.", // EN: Show devices left on, locks and energy status on one screen when leaving home.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kmadan \u00f6nce a\u00e7\u0131k kalan \u0131\u015f\u0131k, priz, klima ve g\u00fcvenlik ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 tek panelde g\u00f6r. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma ve g\u00fcvenlik aktif etme ad\u0131mlar\u0131n\u0131 tek ak\u0131\u015fa topla.": "Veja luzes, tomadas, ACs e configura\u00e7\u00f5es de seguran\u00e7a deixadas ligadas antes de sair de casa, em um painel.Re\u00fana etapas r\u00e1pidas de desligamento e ativa\u00e7\u00e3o de seguran\u00e7a em um \u00fanico fluxo.", // EN: See lights, plugs, ACs and security settings left on before leaving home, on one panel. Gather quick shut-off and security activation steps into one flow.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kmadan \u00f6nce son kontrolleri yapal\u0131m.": "Vamos fazer as verifica\u00e7\u00f5es finais antes de voc\u00ea sair.", // EN: Let's do the final checks before you leave.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otom...": "Apague as luzes automaticamente ap\u00f3s sair...", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after leav...
