    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat\u0131n ve eve d\u00f6nd\u00fckten sonra a\u00e7\u0131n.": "Apague as luzes automaticamente ap\u00f3s sair e acenda-as quando retornar.", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after you leave and turn them on when you return.
    "Evde kimse yokken klimay\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat\u0131n, gereksiz t\u00fcketimi \u00f6nleyin.": "Desligue o ar condicionado automaticamente quando n\u00e3o houver ningu\u00e9m em casa e evite consumos desnecess\u00e1rios.", // EN: Turn off the air conditioner automatically when nobody is home and avoid needless consumption.
    "Gece belirledi\u011fin saatte bekleme modundaki cihazlar\u0131n g\u00fcc\u00fcn\u00fc otomatik olarak kesin.": "Corte automaticamente a energia dos dispositivos em modo de espera no hor\u00e1rio que voc\u00ea escolher durante a noite.", // EN: Automatically cut power to devices on standby at the time you choose at night.
