    "E\u015fle\u015ftir ve ekle": "Emparelhar e adicionar", // EN: Pair and add
    "E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodu ge\u00e7ersiz. 11 haneli kodu ya da MT: ile ba\u015flayan QR i\u00e7eri\u011fini gir.": "O c\u00f3digo de emparelhamento n\u00e3o \u00e9 v\u00e1lido.Insira o c\u00f3digo de 11 d\u00edgitos ou o conte\u00fado QR que come\u00e7a com MT:.", // EN: The pairing code is not valid. Enter the 11-digit code or the QR content that starts with MT:.
    "Bu kodu NEXUS masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda gir. Cihaz Wi-Fi ile ba\u011fl\u0131ysa yerel a\u011fdan IP adresiyle de ekleyebilirsin.": "Insira este c\u00f3digo no aplicativo de desktop NEXUS.Se o dispositivo estiver conectado a Wi-Fi, voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m poder\u00e1 adicion\u00e1-lo da sua rede local pelo endere\u00e7o IP.", // EN: Enter this code in the NEXUS desktop app. If the device is on Wi-Fi, you can also add it from your local network by its IP address.
    "Cihaz ayn\u0131 a\u011fda aran\u0131yor ve e\u015fle\u015ftiriliyor. Bu bir dakikay\u0131 bulabilir; cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda olmas\u0131 gerekir.": "O dispositivo est\u00e1 sendo procurado na mesma rede e emparelhado.Isso pode levar at\u00e9 um minuto;o dispositivo deve estar ligado e em modo de emparelhamento.", // EN: The device is being searched for on the same network and paired. This can take up to a minute; the device must be on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131 ya da e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "O dispositivo n\u00e3o foi encontrado ou n\u00e3o p\u00f4de ser emparelhado.Certifique-se de que esteja na mesma rede, ligado e em modo de emparelhamento.", // EN: The device was not found or could not be paired. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol. Bilgisayar\u0131n g\u00fcvenlik duvar\u0131 yerel a\u011fdaki cihazlar\u0131n yan\u0131t\u0131n\u0131 engelliyor olabilir.": "O dispositivo n\u00e3o foi encontrado.Certifique-se de que esteja na mesma rede, ligado e em modo de emparelhamento.O firewall do seu computador pode estar bloqueando respostas de dispositivos na rede local.", // EN: The device was not found. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode. Your computer's firewall may be blocking replies from devices on the local network.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodunu ve cihaz\u0131n e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011funu kontrol et.": "N\u00e3o foi poss\u00edvel emparelhar o dispositivo.Verifique o c\u00f3digo de emparelhamento e se o dispositivo est\u00e1 no modo de emparelhamento.", // EN: The device could not be paired. Check the pairing code and that the device is in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015fti ama NEXUS'un kontrol edebilece\u011fi bir i\u015flevi yok.": "O dispositivo est\u00e1 emparelhado, mas n\u00e3o tem nenhuma fun\u00e7\u00e3o que o NEXUS possa controlar.", // EN: The device paired but has no function NEXUS can control.
    "Cihaz yan\u0131t vermedi. A\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "O dispositivo n\u00e3o respondeu.Certifique-se de que esteja ligado e na mesma rede.", // EN: The device did not respond. Make sure it is on and on the same network.
