    "Tabii ki! Senin i\u00e7in harika bir ak\u0131ll\u0131 senaryo kurgulayabilirim. Bana biraz detay verir misin? \u00d6rne\u011fin: \"Sabah uyand\u0131\u011f\u0131mda kahve makinesi \u00e7al\u0131\u015fs\u0131n\" veya \"Film izlerken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar tamamen k\u0131s\u0131ls\u0131n\" gibi bir istekte bulunabilirsin.": "Claro!Posso montar um \u00f3timo cen\u00e1rio inteligente para voc\u00ea.Voc\u00ea poderia me dar alguns detalhes?Por exemplo: \u201cLigar a m\u00e1quina de caf\u00e9 quando eu acordar\u201d ou \u201cApagar totalmente as luzes quando assistir a um filme\u201d.", // EN: Of course! I can put together a great smart scenario for you. Could you give me a few details? For example: "Start the coffee machine when I wake up" or "Dim the lights fully when I watch a movie".
