    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131, perdeleri ve klimay\u0131 g\u00fcne ba\u015flarken tek dokunu\u015fla haz\u0131rla.": "Prepare luzes, cortinas e ar condicionado para o dia com um toque.", // EN: Get lights, curtains and the AC ready for the day with one tap.
