    "Uzun s\u00fcre evde yokken cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 g\u00fcvenli ve tasarruflu konuma al.": "Coloque seus dispositivos em um estado seguro e de economia de energia enquanto voc\u00ea estiver ausente por muito tempo.", // EN: Put your devices into a safe, energy-saving state while you are away for long.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 k\u0131s, perdeleri kapat ve TV'yi a\u00e7.": "Apague as luzes, feche as cortinas e ligue a TV.", // EN: Dim the lights, close the curtains and turn on the TV.
    "Robot s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeni ba\u015flat ya da \u015farj istasyonuna g\u00f6nder.": "Inicie o aspirador rob\u00f4 ou envie-o de volta para a base.", // EN: Start your robot vacuum or send it back to its dock.
