    "Ekledi\u011fin kameralar\u0131n durumunu ve gizlilik ayar\u0131n\u0131 tek ekranda g\u00f6r.": "Veja o status e as configura\u00e7\u00f5es de privacidade de suas c\u00e2meras em uma tela.", // EN: See the status and privacy setting of your cameras on one screen.
    "Evdeyken kameralar\u0131n i\u00e7in gizlilik modunu tek yerden a\u00e7 ya da kapat.": "Ative ou desative o modo de privacidade de suas c\u00e2meras em um s\u00f3 lugar enquanto estiver em casa.", // EN: Turn privacy mode for your cameras on or off from one place while you are home.
    "Bug\u00fcn hangi otomasyonun ne zaman \u00e7al\u0131\u015faca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 g\u00f6r.": "Veja qual automa\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 executada hoje.", // EN: See which automation runs when today.
