    "Robot s\u00fcp\u00fcrge kontrol paneli \u00b7 ba\u015flat, durdur, eve d\u00f6n": "Painel de controle de v\u00e1cuo do rob\u00f4 \u00b7 iniciar, parar, voltar para casa", // EN: Robot vacuum control panel · start, stop, return home
