    "Hareket sens\u00f6r\u00fc paneli \u00b7 alg\u0131lama ve uyar\u0131lar": "Painel de sensor de movimento \u00b7 detec\u00e7\u00e3o e alertas", // EN: Motion sensor panel · detection and alerts
