    "Bah\u00e7e ve sulama kontrol paneli \u00b7 vana, zamanlama": "Painel de controle de jardim e irriga\u00e7\u00e3o \u00b7 v\u00e1lvula, programa\u00e7\u00e3o", // EN: Garden and irrigation control panel · valve, scheduling
    "Medya kontrol paneli \u00b7 a\u00e7, kapat, ses, kanal": "Painel de controle de m\u00eddia \u00b7 ligado, desligado, volume, canal", // EN: Media control panel · on, off, volume, channel
    "Ev aletleri kontrol paneli \u00b7 ba\u015flat, durdur, program": "Painel de controle de eletrodom\u00e9sticos \u00b7 iniciar, parar, programar", // EN: Home appliance control panel · start, stop, program
    "\u0130klim kontrol paneli \u00b7 s\u0131cakl\u0131k, nem, mod": "Painel de controle clim\u00e1tico \u00b7 temperatura, umidade, modo", // EN: Climate control panel · temperature, humidity, mode
    "Ortam sens\u00f6r\u00fc paneli \u00b7 s\u0131cakl\u0131k, \u0131\u015f\u0131k, durum": "Painel de sensor ambiente \u00b7 temperatura, luz, status", // EN: Ambient sensor panel · temperature, light, status
    "Priz ve enerji kontrol paneli \u00b7 a\u00e7, kapat, t\u00fcketim": "Painel de controle de tomada e energia \u00b7 ligar, desligar, consumo", // EN: Plug and energy control panel · on, off, consumption
    "Ula\u015f\u0131m ve takip paneli \u00b7 konum, \u015farj": "Painel de transporte e rastreamento \u00b7 localiza\u00e7\u00e3o, cobran\u00e7a", // EN: Transport and tracking panel · location, charge
    "A\u011f ge\u00e7idi paneli \u00b7 ba\u011flant\u0131, durum": "Painel gateway \u00b7 conex\u00e3o, status", // EN: Gateway panel · connection, status
    "Anahtar kontrol paneli \u00b7 a\u00e7, kapat": "Ligar, desligar o painel de controle", // EN: Switch control panel · on, off
    "Bu ad ana sayfa kart\u0131nda ve cihaz listesinde g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "Esse nome aparece no cart\u00e3o inicial e na lista de dispositivos.", // EN: This name shows on the home card and in the device list.
    "Cihaz ad\u0131n\u0131 de\u011fi\u015ftir": "Renomear dispositivo", // EN: Rename device
    "\u015eifre Belirle": "Definir uma senha", // EN: Set a password
    "Bu hesapta hen\u00fcz \u015fifre yok": "Esta conta ainda n\u00e3o tem senha", // EN: This account has no password yet
    "\u015eifren belirlendi \u2713": "Sua senha est\u00e1 definida \u2713", // EN: Your password is set ✓
    "Bu hesap Google ile a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131, i\u00e7inde hen\u00fcz bir \u015fifre yok. \u0130lk \u015fifreni burada belirleyebilirsin; bundan sonra e-posta ve \u015fifreyle de giri\u015f yapabilirsin.": "Esta conta foi aberta no Google e ainda n\u00e3o possui senha.Defina sua primeira senha aqui;depois disso voc\u00ea tamb\u00e9m pode fazer login com e-mail e senha.", // EN: This account was opened with Google and has no password yet. Set your first password here; after that you can also sign in with email and password.
    "\u015eifre belirleme ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 e-postama g\u00f6nder": "Envie-me um link de configura\u00e7\u00e3o de senha por e-mail", // EN: Email me a password setup link
    "Bu i\u015flem ek do\u011frulama istiyor. A\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan \u015fifre belirleme ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 isteyebilirsin.": "Esta a\u00e7\u00e3o precisa de verifica\u00e7\u00e3o extra.Voc\u00ea pode solicitar um link de configura\u00e7\u00e3o de senha abaixo.", // EN: This action needs extra verification. You can request a password setup link below.
    "\u015eifre belirleme ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 e-postana g\u00f6nderildi \u2713": "Link de configura\u00e7\u00e3o de senha enviado para sua caixa de entrada \u2713", // EN: Password setup link sent to your inbox ✓
    "\u015eifre ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 \u015fu anda g\u00f6nderilemiyor.": "O link da senha n\u00e3o pode ser enviado no momento.", // EN: The password link can't be sent right now.
    "Giri\u015f e-postan bulunamad\u0131; \u00f6nce giri\u015f yap.": "N\u00e3o foi poss\u00edvel encontrar seu e-mail de login;fa\u00e7a login primeiro.", // EN: We couldn't find your sign-in email; sign in first.
    "Ba\u011flant\u0131 g\u00f6nderilemedi. Birazdan tekrar dene.": "N\u00e3o foi poss\u00edvel enviar o link.Tente novamente em alguns instantes.", // EN: The link couldn't be sent. Try again in a moment.
