    "Cihaz listesi, otomasyonlar, senaryolar ve ayarlar bir dosyaya kaydedilir. Cihaz parolalar\u0131, yerel anahtarlar, Telegram anahtar\u0131 ve oturum bilgisi yede\u011fe girmez.": "Sua lista de dispositivos, automa\u00e7\u00f5es, cenas e configura\u00e7\u00f5es s\u00e3o salvas em um arquivo.Senhas de dispositivos, chaves locais, token do Telegram e sua sess\u00e3o n\u00e3o est\u00e3o inclu\u00eddos no backup.", // EN: Your device list, automations, scenes and settings are saved to a file. Device passwords, local keys, the Telegram token and your session are not included in the backup.
    "Yede\u011fi d\u0131\u015fa aktar": "Exportar backup", // EN: Export backup
    "Hata Raporu": "Relat\u00f3rio de erros", // EN: Error Report
    "Uygulamada olu\u015fan hatalar otomatik ve anonim olarak (ki\u015fisel veri olmadan) bize iletilir. \u0130stersen a\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan kapatabilirsin.": "Erros que acontecem no aplicativo s\u00e3o enviados para n\u00f3s de forma autom\u00e1tica e an\u00f4nima (sem dados pessoais).Voc\u00ea pode deslig\u00e1-lo abaixo.", // EN: Errors that happen in the app are sent to us automatically and anonymously (no personal data). You can turn it off below.
    "Anonim Hata Raporu G\u00f6nder": "Enviar relat\u00f3rios de erros an\u00f4nimos", // EN: Send Anonymous Error Reports
    "Anonim hata raporu g\u00f6nder": "Envie relat\u00f3rios de erros an\u00f4nimos", // EN: Send anonymous error reports
    "Yedekten geri y\u00fckle": "Restaurar do backup", // EN: Restore from backup
    "E\u015fle\u015fmi\u015f cihazlar\u0131na g\u00f6re haz\u0131r; tek dokunu\u015fla eklenir.": "Pronto para seus dispositivos emparelhados;adicionado com um \u00fanico toque.", // EN: Ready for your paired devices; added with a single tap.
    "Senin i\u00e7in haz\u0131r": "Pronto para voc\u00ea", // EN: Ready for you
    "Dokununca e\u015fle\u015fmi\u015f cihazlar\u0131nda hemen \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "\u00c9 executado em seus dispositivos emparelhados assim que voc\u00ea toca nele.", // EN: Runs on your paired devices as soon as you tap it.
