    "Ana men\u00fc": "Menu principal", // EN: Main menu
    "Temay\u0131 de\u011fi\u015ftir": "Alterar tema", // EN: Change theme
    "L\u00fctfen ge\u00e7erli bir e-posta gir.": "Por favor insira um e-mail v\u00e1lido.", // EN: Please enter a valid email.
    "Bu e-posta ile zaten bir hesap var. L\u00fctfen giri\u015f yap\u0131n.": "J\u00e1 existe uma conta com este e-mail.Fa\u00e7a login.", // EN: An account with this email already exists. Please sign in.
    "Ba\u011flant\u0131n\u0131n s\u00fcresi dolmu\u015f ya da ge\u00e7ersiz. L\u00fctfen yeniden dene.": "Este link expirou ou \u00e9 inv\u00e1lido.Por favor, tente novamente.", // EN: This link has expired or is invalid. Please try again.
    "Bulut hesab\u0131 bu s\u00fcr\u00fcmde kapal\u0131; yerel hesaplarda \u015fifre s\u0131f\u0131rlanamaz.": "A conta na nuvem est\u00e1 desativada nesta compila\u00e7\u00e3o;as senhas das contas locais n\u00e3o podem ser redefinidas.", // EN: Cloud account is disabled in this build; local account passwords cannot be reset.
    "Bu adres bir hesaba ba\u011fl\u0131ysa s\u0131f\u0131rlama ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 g\u00f6nderildi. Gelen kutunu (ve gereksiz klas\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fc) kontrol et.": "Se este endere\u00e7o estiver vinculado a uma conta, um link de redefini\u00e7\u00e3o foi enviado.Verifique sua caixa de entrada (e pasta de spam).", // EN: If this address is linked to an account, a reset link has been sent. Check your inbox (and spam folder).
    "\u00c7ok s\u0131k denedin. Bir dakika sonra tekrar dene.": "Muitas tentativas.Tente novamente em um minuto.", // EN: Too many attempts. Please try again in a minute.
