    "Mevcut \u015fifre yanl\u0131\u015f.": "A senha atual est\u00e1 incorreta.", // EN: Current password is incorrect.
    "Yeni \u015fifre eskisinden farkl\u0131 olmal\u0131.": "A nova senha deve ser diferente da antiga.", // EN: New password must differ from the old one.
    "Oturum bulunamad\u0131. \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f yap\u0131p tekrar giri\u015f yap.": "Sess\u00e3o n\u00e3o encontrada.Saia e fa\u00e7a login novamente.", // EN: Session not found. Sign out and sign in again.
