    "Son 7 g\u00fcn \u00b7 yaln\u0131zca bu cihazdaki ger\u00e7ek \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcmlerden": "\u00daltimos 7 dias \u00b7 somente a partir de medi\u00e7\u00f5es reais neste dispositivo", // EN: Last 7 days · from real measurements on this device only
    "Son 7 g\u00fcn": "\u00daltimos 7 dias", // EN: Last 7 days
    "Hen\u00fcz kay\u0131tl\u0131 \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcm yok. G\u00fc\u00e7 \u00f6l\u00e7en bir cihaz ekleyip bu sayfay\u0131 a\u00e7t\u0131\u011f\u0131nda okumalar burada birikir.": "Nenhuma medi\u00e7\u00e3o registrada ainda.Adicione um dispositivo que mede pot\u00eancia e abra esta p\u00e1gina;as leituras se acumular\u00e3o aqui.", // EN: No measurements recorded yet. Add a device that measures power and open this page; readings will build up here.
    "\u00d6l\u00e7\u00fcm al\u0131nmayan aral\u0131klar hesaba kat\u0131lmaz; bu y\u00fczden de\u011ferler ger\u00e7ek t\u00fcketimden d\u00fc\u015f\u00fck olabilir.": "Os intervalos sem medi\u00e7\u00f5es n\u00e3o s\u00e3o contabilizados, pelo que os valores podem ser inferiores ao consumo real.", // EN: Intervals without measurements are not counted, so values may be lower than actual consumption.
