    "Para birimi": "Moeda", // EN: Currency
    "Tahmini maliyet; fatura de\u011fildir. Fiyat yaln\u0131zca bu cihazda saklan\u0131r.": "Custo estimado, n\u00e3o uma conta.O pre\u00e7o \u00e9 armazenado apenas neste dispositivo.", // EN: Estimated cost, not a bill. The price is stored on this device only.
    "G\u00fcnl\u00fck t\u00fcketim, son 7 g\u00fcn (kWh)": "Uso di\u00e1rio, \u00faltimos 7 dias (kWh)", // EN: Daily usage, last 7 days (kWh)
