    "Cihaz eklenince haz\u0131r senaryolar burada g\u00f6r\u00fcnecek.": "Cenas prontas aparecer\u00e3o aqui assim que voc\u00ea adicionar um dispositivo.", // EN: Ready-made scenes will appear here once you add a device.
