    "Yerel oturum": "Sess\u00e3o local", // EN: Local session
    "\u0130zin yok": "Sem permiss\u00e3o", // EN: No permission
    "Bu evde cihaz kontrol iznin yok. Ev sahibi izni a\u00e7abilir.": "Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o tem permiss\u00e3o de controle de dispositivos nesta casa.O propriet\u00e1rio pode lig\u00e1-lo.", // EN: You don't have device control permission in this home. The owner can turn it on.
    "Mesaj\u0131 Sil": "Excluir mensagem", // EN: Delete Message
    "Bu mesaj t\u00fcm \u00fcyeler i\u00e7in silinir.": "Esta mensagem \u00e9 exclu\u00edda para todos os membros.", // EN: This message is deleted for all members.
    "Son 15 dk i\u00e7inde": "Nos \u00faltimos 15 minutos", // EN: Within the last 15 minutes
    "Aile mesajlar\u0131 ve payla\u015f\u0131lan uyar\u0131lar": "Mensagens familiares e alertas compartilhados", // EN: Family messages and shared alerts
    "Kritik uyar\u0131lar\u0131 payla\u015f": "Compartilhe alertas cr\u00edticos", // EN: Share critical alerts
    "Bu cihazdaki g\u00fcvenlik/acil olaylar\u0131n ba\u015fl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve k\u0131sa metni evdeki di\u011fer \u00fcyelerin uygulamas\u0131nda g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr. Cihaz bilgileri ve anahtarlar payla\u015f\u0131lmaz; her \u00fcye kendi bildirim ayarlar\u0131na tabidir.": "O t\u00edtulo e o texto curto dos eventos de seguran\u00e7a/emerg\u00eancia neste dispositivo aparecem nos aplicativos de outros membros nesta casa.Os detalhes e chaves do dispositivo nunca s\u00e3o compartilhados;cada membro segue suas pr\u00f3prias configura\u00e7\u00f5es de notifica\u00e7\u00e3o.", // EN: The title and short text of security/emergency events on this device appear in other members' apps in this home. Device details and keys are never shared; every member follows their own notification settings.
    "Evden Ayr\u0131l": "Sair de casa", // EN: Leave Home
    "Ayr\u0131l": "Sair", // EN: Leave
    "Davet e-postas\u0131ndaki kodu gir. Kod tek kullan\u0131ml\u0131kt\u0131r ve yaln\u0131zca davet edilen e-posta adresiyle \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Digite o c\u00f3digo do e-mail de convite.O c\u00f3digo \u00e9 descart\u00e1vel e s\u00f3 funciona com o endere\u00e7o de e-mail convidado.", // EN: Enter the code from the invitation email. The code is single-use and only works with the invited email address.
    "Oturum gerekli": "\u00c9 necess\u00e1rio fazer login", // EN: Sign-in required
    "\u00dcye davet etmek i\u00e7in \u00f6nce oturum a\u00e7; evin hesab\u0131na otomatik ba\u011flan\u0131r.": "Fa\u00e7a login primeiro para convidar membros;voc\u00ea ser\u00e1 conectado \u00e0 conta da sua casa automaticamente.", // EN: Sign in first to invite members; you'll be connected to your home's account automatically.
    "E-posta sunucudan g\u00f6nderilemedi": "O e-mail n\u00e3o p\u00f4de ser enviado do servidor", // EN: The email couldn't be sent from the server
    "Davet olu\u015fturuldu ama otomatik e-posta g\u00f6nderilemedi. Kendi posta uygulamanla davet metnini haz\u0131rlayal\u0131m m\u0131?": "O convite foi criado, mas n\u00e3o foi poss\u00edvel enviar o e-mail autom\u00e1tico.Vamos preparar o texto do convite com seu pr\u00f3prio aplicativo de email?", // EN: The invite was created but the automatic email couldn't be sent. Shall we prepare the invitation text with your own mail app?
    "Posta Uygulamas\u0131n\u0131 A\u00e7": "Abra o aplicativo Mail", // EN: Open Mail App
    "I\u015f\u0131k d\u00fczeyi": "N\u00edvel de luz", // EN: Light level
    "Bas\u0131n\u00e7": "Press\u00e3o", // EN: Pressure
    "Hareket alg\u0131land\u0131": "Movimento detectado", // EN: Motion detected
    "Hareket yok": "Sem movimento", // EN: No motion
    "Cihaza ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "N\u00e3o foi poss\u00edvel conectar ao dispositivo.Certifique-se de que esteja na mesma rede.", // EN: Couldn't connect to the device. Make sure it's on the same network.
    "Cihaza ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan, IP adresinin ve yerel anahtar\u0131n do\u011fru oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "N\u00e3o foi poss\u00edvel conectar ao dispositivo.Certifique-se de que esteja na mesma rede e que o endere\u00e7o IP e a chave local estejam corretos.", // EN: Couldn't connect to the device. Make sure it's on the same network and that the IP address and local key are correct.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 s\u0131cak tonda a\u00e7ar, perdeleri a\u00e7ar, klimay\u0131 22\u00b0 yapar.": "Acende as luzes em tom quente, abre as cortinas e ajusta o ar condicionado para 22\u00b0.", // EN: Turns the lights on in a warm tone, opens the curtains and sets the AC to 22°.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve perdeleri a\u00e7ar, klimay\u0131 22\u00b0 \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r, s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeyi \u015farja g\u00f6nderir.": "Acende as luzes e abre as cortinas, liga o AC a 22\u00b0 e manda o aspirador de volta para carregar.", // EN: Turns on the lights and opens the curtains, runs the AC at 22° and sends the vacuum back to charge.
    "I\u015f\u0131k, TV ve klimay\u0131 kapat\u0131r, perdeleri kapat\u0131r, kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitler.": "Apaga as luzes, TV e AC, fecha as cortinas e tranca a porta.", // EN: Turns off the lights, TV and AC, closes the curtains and locks the door.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve TV'yi kapat\u0131r, perdeleri kapat\u0131r, kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitler.": "Apaga as luzes e a TV, fecha as cortinas e tranca a porta.", // EN: Turns off the lights and TV, closes the curtains and locks the door.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %15 s\u0131cak tona getirir, perdeleri kapat\u0131r, TV'yi a\u00e7ar.": "Ajusta as luzes para um tom quente em 15%, fecha as cortinas e liga a TV.", // EN: Sets the lights to a warm tone at 15%, closes the curtains and turns on the TV.
    "Kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitler, perdeleri kapat\u0131r.": "Tranca a porta e fecha as cortinas.", // EN: Locks the door and closes the curtains.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %70 parlakl\u0131kta a\u00e7ar.": "Acende as luzes com 70% de brilho.", // EN: Turns the lights on at 70% brightness.
    "Robot s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeyi ba\u015flat\u0131r.": "Inicia o aspirador do rob\u00f4.", // EN: Starts the robot vacuum.
    "Hafta i\u00e7i 10:00": "Dias de semana 10:00", // EN: Weekdays 10:00
    "Klimay\u0131 ve termostat\u0131 konfor ayar\u0131na getirir, hava temizleyiciyi \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r.": "Define o AC e o termostato para a configura\u00e7\u00e3o de conforto e liga o purificador de ar.", // EN: Sets the AC and thermostat to the comfort setting and runs the air purifier.
    "Bildirim g\u00f6nderir": "Envia uma notifica\u00e7\u00e3o", // EN: Sends a notification
    "Bu senaryo mevcut cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 etkilemiyor. Senaryonun \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmas\u0131 i\u00e7in uygun bir cihaz (\u00f6r. \u0131\u015f\u0131k, perde, s\u00fcp\u00fcrge) eklemelisin.": "Este cen\u00e1rio n\u00e3o afeta nenhum dos seus dispositivos atuais.Para que funcione, adicione um dispositivo adequado (por exemplo, uma luz, cortina ou aspirador).", // EN: This scenario doesn't affect any of your current devices. To make it work, add a suitable device (e.g. a light, curtain or vacuum).
    "Yeni bir ev olu\u015ftur ya da sana g\u00f6nderilen davet koduyla bir eve kat\u0131l.": "Crie uma nova casa ou junte-se a uma com o c\u00f3digo de convite enviado a voc\u00ea.", // EN: Create a new home, or join one with the invite code sent to you.
    "Oturum a\u00e7\u0131k de\u011fil. Evler yaln\u0131zca bu cihazda tutulur. \u00dcye davet etmek, bir eve kat\u0131lmak ve aile sohbeti i\u00e7in oturum a\u00e7.": "Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o fez login. As casas s\u00e3o mantidas apenas neste dispositivo.Fa\u00e7a login para convidar membros, entrar em uma casa e usar o bate-papo familiar.", // EN: You're not signed in. Homes are kept on this device only. Sign in to invite members, join a home and use the family chat.
