    "A\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki cihazlar internet ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 olmadan, ev a\u011f\u0131nda NEXUS'a ba\u011flan\u0131r. Ekledi\u011fin cihazlar {0} modelden se\u00e7ilir.": "Os dispositivos abaixo se conectam ao NEXUS na sua rede dom\u00e9stica, sem conex\u00e3o com a internet.Escolha entre {0} modelos.", // EN: The devices below connect to NEXUS on your home network, without an internet connection. Choose from {0} models.
    "NEXUS, cihazlar\u0131na do\u011frudan kendi uygulamas\u0131ndan eri\u015fir; HomeKit k\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fc i\u00e7ermez. Apple Ev (HomeKit) ile kullanmak istersen en pratik yol {0}: cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 Home Assistant'a ekler, HA'n\u0131n HomeKit entegrasyonunu a\u00e7ars\u0131n.": "NEXUS chega aos seus dispositivos diretamente de seu pr\u00f3prio aplicativo;n\u00e3o possui ponte HomeKit integrada.Para utiliz\u00e1-los com o Apple Home (HomeKit), o caminho pr\u00e1tico \u00e9 {0}: adicione seus dispositivos ao Home Assistant e ative a integra\u00e7\u00e3o do HomeKit do HA.", // EN: NEXUS reaches your devices directly from its own app; it has no built-in HomeKit bridge. To use them with Apple Home (HomeKit), the practical path is {0}: add your devices to Home Assistant, then enable HA's HomeKit integration.
    "NEXUS, cihazlar\u0131na do\u011frudan kendi uygulamas\u0131ndan eri\u015fir; {0} yerle\u015fik bir HomeKit k\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fc Apple Ev'e ger\u00e7ek aksesuar yay\u0131nlar (a\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki panelden ba\u015flat). Web/telefon s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fcnde k\u00f6pr\u00fc yoktur.": "NEXUS chega aos seus dispositivos diretamente de seu pr\u00f3prio aplicativo;no desktop, o {0} HomeKit Bridge integrado publica acess\u00f3rios reais para o Apple Home (inicie-o no painel abaixo).A vers\u00e3o web/telefone n\u00e3o possui bridge.", // EN: NEXUS reaches your devices directly from its own app; on desktop, {0} built-in HomeKit bridge publishes real accessories to Apple Home (start it from the panel below). The web/phone version has no bridge.
    "NEXUS, cihazlar\u0131na do\u011frudan kendi uygulamas\u0131ndan eri\u015fir; telefon/web s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fcnde HomeKit k\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fc i\u00e7ermez. Apple Ev (HomeKit) ile kullanmak istersen en pratik yol {0}: cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 Home Assistant'a ekler, HA'n\u0131n HomeKit entegrasyonunu a\u00e7ars\u0131n.": "NEXUS chega aos seus dispositivos diretamente de seu pr\u00f3prio aplicativo;a vers\u00e3o telefone/web n\u00e3o inclui uma ponte HomeKit.Para utiliz\u00e1-los com o Apple Home (HomeKit), o caminho pr\u00e1tico \u00e9 {0}: adicione seus dispositivos ao Home Assistant e ative a integra\u00e7\u00e3o do HomeKit do HA.", // EN: NEXUS reaches your devices directly from its own app; the phone/web version does not include a HomeKit bridge. To use them with Apple Home (HomeKit), the practical path is {0}: add your devices to Home Assistant, then enable HA's HomeKit integration.
    "NEXUS'ta {0} \u00fczerinden Home Assistant'\u0131 ba\u011fla.": "Conecte o Home Assistant por meio de {0} no NEXUS.", // EN: Connect Home Assistant through {0} in NEXUS.
    "Home Assistant ayarlar\u0131ndan {0} entegrasyonunu ekle; payla\u015fmak istedi\u011fin cihazlar\u0131 se\u00e7.": "Nas configura\u00e7\u00f5es do Home Assistant, adicione a integra\u00e7\u00e3o {0} e escolha os dispositivos que deseja compartilhar.", // EN: In Home Assistant settings, add the {0} integration and pick the devices you want to share.
    "\u00d6deme sayfas\u0131nda {0} kullan; abonelik bu e-postayla e\u015fle\u015fir. Deneme s\u00fcresi bitmeden iptal edersen \u00fccret al\u0131nmaz. Aboneli\u011fini Faturaland\u0131rma sayfas\u0131ndan istedi\u011fin an y\u00f6netebilirsin.": "Use {0} na p\u00e1gina de pagamento;sua assinatura corresponde a este e-mail.Cancele antes do t\u00e9rmino da avalia\u00e7\u00e3o e voc\u00ea nunca ser\u00e1 cobrado.Gerencie sua assinatura a qualquer momento na p\u00e1gina Faturamento.", // EN: Use {0} on the payment page; your subscription is matched to this email. Cancel before the trial ends and you're never charged. Manage your subscription any time from the Billing page.
